# CODEOWNERS — review requirements for the paths that gate the project.
# With a single maintainer every path resolves to @lexbity; the explicit
# entries below document (and pin) which areas must never change without
# maintainer review, so a future second committer cannot weaken them silently.
* @lexbity

.github/**        @lexbity   # CI workflows, Dependabot, this file
CMakeLists.txt    @lexbity   # build orchestration and gate targets
cmake/**          @lexbity
cmd/lurpiclint/** @lexbity   # the analyzer the lint gate runs
scripts/lint/**   @lexbity   # drift/suppression guards the gate runs
